      "clozeText": "Exploring wildlife documentaries on national geographic provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in documentary channel or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with polar bears in Arctic. Many students find that taking nature notes helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about ocean dolphins broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
