      "audioScript": "David: Hello Hoa! What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Swimming Safety and Water Skills for Students related to municipal pool.\nDavid: What is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nHoa: Audiences and participants are fascinated by swimming goggles and love swimming freestyle.\nDavid: How does it inspire young students?\nHoa: It encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of breathing techniques, and highlights swimming instructor.\nDavid: That is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring swimming safety and water skills for students provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in municipal pool or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with swimming goggles. Many students find that swimming freestyle helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about breathing techniques broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Swimming Safety and Water Skills for Students has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate municipal pool. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases swimming goggles and provides deep perspectives on breathing techniques. Many teenagers report that participating in swimming freestyle enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize swimming instructor as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring swimming safety and water skills for students provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in municipal pool or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with swimming goggles. Many students find that swimming freestyle helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about breathing techniques broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSwimming Safety and Water Skills for Students has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate municipal pool. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases swimming goggles and provides deep perspectives on breathing techniques. Many teenagers report that participating in swimming freestyle enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize swimming instructor as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Why you like it; Important features of municipal pool; What benefits it brings; How it helps your study.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Swimming Safety and Water Skills for Students is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with municipal pool while promoting swimming goggles. Engaging in swimming freestyle helps students relieve academic stress and develop breathing techniques. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of swimming instructor encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
