      "audioScript": "Tom: Hello Linh! What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Sydney - Iconic Opera House and Harbour Bridge related to Sydney.\nTom: What is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nLinh: Audiences and participants are fascinated by Opera House sails and love taking ferry cruise.\nTom: How does it inspire young students?\nLinh: It encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of Harbour Bridge, and highlights koala sanctuary.\nTom: That is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring sydney - iconic opera house and harbour bridge provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in Sydney or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with Opera House sails. Many students find that taking ferry cruise helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about Harbour Bridge broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Sydney - Iconic Opera House and Harbour Bridge has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate Sydney. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases Opera House sails and provides deep perspectives on Harbour Bridge. Many teenagers report that participating in taking ferry cruise enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize koala sanctuary as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring sydney - iconic opera house and harbour bridge provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in Sydney or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with Opera House sails. Many students find that taking ferry cruise helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about Harbour Bridge broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSydney - Iconic Opera House and Harbour Bridge has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate Sydney. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases Opera House sails and provides deep perspectives on Harbour Bridge. Many teenagers report that participating in taking ferry cruise enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize koala sanctuary as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
