      "audioScript": "Tom: Hello Linh! What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Martial Arts and Vovinam Training for Teenagers related to martial arts dojo.\nTom: What is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nLinh: Audiences and participants are fascinated by blue uniforms and love learning defensive moves.\nTom: How does it inspire young students?\nLinh: It encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of discipline and respect, and highlights master instructor.\nTom: That is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring martial arts and vovinam training for teenagers provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in martial arts dojo or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with blue uniforms. Many students find that learning defensive moves helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about discipline and respect broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Martial Arts and Vovinam Training for Teenagers has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate martial arts dojo. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases blue uniforms and provides deep perspectives on discipline and respect. Many teenagers report that participating in learning defensive moves enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize master instructor as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring martial arts and vovinam training for teenagers provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in martial arts dojo or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with blue uniforms. Many students find that learning defensive moves helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about discipline and respect broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nMartial Arts and Vovinam Training for Teenagers has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate martial arts dojo. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases blue uniforms and provides deep perspectives on discipline and respect. Many teenagers report that participating in learning defensive moves enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize master instructor as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Why you like it; Important features of martial arts dojo; What benefits it brings; How it helps your study.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Martial Arts and Vovinam Training for Teenagers is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with martial arts dojo while promoting blue uniforms. Engaging in learning defensive moves helps students relieve academic stress and develop discipline and respect. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of master instructor encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
