      "audioScript": "Tom: Hello Linh! What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about How Modern Smart Televisions Connect Families related to cozy living room.\nTom: What is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nLinh: Audiences and participants are fascinated by high-definition screen and love discussing moral plots.\nTom: How does it inspire young students?\nLinh: It encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of family movie nights, and highlights smart remote.\nTom: That is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring how modern smart televisions connect families provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in cozy living room or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with high-definition screen. Many students find that discussing moral plots helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about family movie nights broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "How Modern Smart Televisions Connect Families has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate cozy living room. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases high-definition screen and provides deep perspectives on family movie nights. Many teenagers report that participating in discussing moral plots enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize smart remote as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring how modern smart televisions connect families provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in cozy living room or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with high-definition screen. Many students find that discussing moral plots helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about family movie nights broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHow Modern Smart Televisions Connect Families has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate cozy living room. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases high-definition screen and provides deep perspectives on family movie nights. Many teenagers report that participating in discussing moral plots enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize smart remote as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
