      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Why you like it; Important features of basketball court; What benefits it brings; How it helps your study.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Basketball Drills and Health Benefits for Youths is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with basketball court while promoting hoop and backboard. Engaging in passing the ball helps students relieve academic stress and develop dribbling skills. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of sports shoes encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
