      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Managing Screen Time for Healthy Eyes and Mind is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with home study desk while promoting timed viewing timer. Engaging in reading books helps students relieve academic stress and develop outdoor exercise. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of healthy vision encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
