      "audioScript": "David: Hello Hoa! What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about The Olympic Games and International Sportsmanship related to Olympic stadium.\nDavid: What is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nHoa: Audiences and participants are fascinated by five coloured rings and love running sprint.\nDavid: How does it inspire young students?\nHoa: It encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of fair play rules, and highlights flame torch.\nDavid: That is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring the olympic games and international sportsmanship provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in Olympic stadium or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with five coloured rings. Many students find that running sprint helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about fair play rules broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "The Olympic Games and International Sportsmanship has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate Olympic stadium. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases five coloured rings and provides deep perspectives on fair play rules. Many teenagers report that participating in running sprint enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize flame torch as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring the olympic games and international sportsmanship provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in Olympic stadium or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with five coloured rings. Many students find that running sprint helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about fair play rules broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Olympic Games and International Sportsmanship has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate Olympic stadium. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases five coloured rings and provides deep perspectives on fair play rules. Many teenagers report that participating in running sprint enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize flame torch as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Why you like it; Important features of Olympic stadium; What benefits it brings; How it helps your study.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, The Olympic Games and International Sportsmanship is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with Olympic stadium while promoting five coloured rings. Engaging in running sprint helps students relieve academic stress and develop fair play rules. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of flame torch encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
