      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Traffic Safety and Helmet Regulations for Students plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in school traffic gate reminds everyone of the paramount importance of fastening safety helmets. When taking part in cycling in bike lanes, people learn how zebra pedestrian crossings enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to traffic police officer ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
