          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Mid-Autumn Festival Lantern Parade and Mooncakes.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of village square; Why star-shaped colourful lanterns is important; Safety rules or cultural values; Your opinion.",
