      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about An Inspiring Nature Documentary about Oceans at film festival hall.\nTom: What is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nLinh: Audiences and participants are amazed by underwater cinematography and enjoy watching marine documentaries.\nTom: How does it teach students valuable lessons?\nLinh: It promotes coral reef conservation and emphasizes the vital role of marine biologist narrator.\nTom: That is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in film festival hall or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that watching marine documentaries provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, underwater cinematography continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "An Inspiring Nature Documentary about Oceans offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in film festival hall. Every year, thousands of people experience underwater cinematography and celebrate coral reef conservation, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in watching marine documentaries gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize marine biologist narrator to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in film festival hall or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that watching marine documentaries provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, underwater cinematography continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAn Inspiring Nature Documentary about Oceans offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in film festival hall. Every year, thousands of people experience underwater cinematography and celebrate coral reef conservation, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in watching marine documentaries gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize marine biologist narrator to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
