      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, An Inspiring Nature Documentary about Oceans plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in film festival hall reminds everyone of the paramount importance of underwater cinematography. When taking part in watching marine documentaries, people learn how coral reef conservation enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to marine biologist narrator ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
