      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Animated Blockbusters and Voice Acting Art at animation studio.\nDavid: What is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nHoa: Audiences and participants are amazed by hand-drawn sketches and enjoy analyzing animated plots.\nDavid: How does it teach students valuable lessons?\nHoa: It promotes emotional character voices and emphasizes the vital role of award-winning animator.\nDavid: That is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in animation studio or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that analyzing animated plots provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, hand-drawn sketches continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Animated Blockbusters and Voice Acting Art offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in animation studio. Every year, thousands of people experience hand-drawn sketches and celebrate emotional character voices, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in analyzing animated plots gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize award-winning animator to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in animation studio or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that analyzing animated plots provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, hand-drawn sketches continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAnimated Blockbusters and Voice Acting Art offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in animation studio. Every year, thousands of people experience hand-drawn sketches and celebrate emotional character voices, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in analyzing animated plots gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize award-winning animator to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of animation studio; Why hand-drawn sketches is important; Safety rules or cultural values; Your opinion.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Animated Blockbusters and Voice Acting Art plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in animation studio reminds everyone of the paramount importance of hand-drawn sketches. When taking part in analyzing animated plots, people learn how emotional character voices enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to award-winning animator ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
