      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about La Tomatina - The Famous Tomato Festival in Spain at Bunol village.\nDavid: What is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nHoa: Audiences and participants are amazed by ripe tomato throwing and enjoy joining tomato battles.\nDavid: How does it teach students valuable lessons?\nHoa: It promotes crowd singing and water cannons and emphasizes the vital role of festival clean-up truck.\nDavid: That is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in Bunol village or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that joining tomato battles provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, ripe tomato throwing continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "La Tomatina - The Famous Tomato Festival in Spain offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in Bunol village. Every year, thousands of people experience ripe tomato throwing and celebrate crowd singing and water cannons, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in joining tomato battles gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize festival clean-up truck to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in Bunol village or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that joining tomato battles provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, ripe tomato throwing continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nLa Tomatina - The Famous Tomato Festival in Spain offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in Bunol village. Every year, thousands of people experience ripe tomato throwing and celebrate crowd singing and water cannons, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in joining tomato battles gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize festival clean-up truck to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of Bunol village; Why ripe tomato throwing is important; Safety rules or cultural values; Your opinion.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, La Tomatina - The Famous Tomato Festival in Spain plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in Bunol village reminds everyone of the paramount importance of ripe tomato throwing. When taking part in joining tomato battles, people learn how crowd singing and water cannons enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to festival clean-up truck ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
