      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Heartwarming Family Comedies and Life Values at cozy home television.\nDavid: What is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nHoa: Audiences and participants are amazed by witty comic dialogues and enjoy laughing with family.\nDavid: How does it teach students valuable lessons?\nHoa: It promotes humorous everyday mishaps and emphasizes the vital role of comic scriptwriter.\nDavid: That is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in cozy home television or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that laughing with family provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, witty comic dialogues continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Heartwarming Family Comedies and Life Values offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in cozy home television. Every year, thousands of people experience witty comic dialogues and celebrate humorous everyday mishaps, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in laughing with family gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize comic scriptwriter to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in cozy home television or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that laughing with family provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, witty comic dialogues continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHeartwarming Family Comedies and Life Values offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in cozy home television. Every year, thousands of people experience witty comic dialogues and celebrate humorous everyday mishaps, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in laughing with family gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize comic scriptwriter to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of cozy home television; Why witty comic dialogues is important; Safety rules or cultural values; Your opinion.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Heartwarming Family Comedies and Life Values plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in cozy home television reminds everyone of the paramount importance of witty comic dialogues. When taking part in laughing with family, people learn how humorous everyday mishaps enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to comic scriptwriter ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
