      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_7_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Safety Rules on Public Trains and Metro Lines at metro railway station.\nDavid: What is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nHoa: Audiences and participants are amazed by safety platform doors and enjoy riding clean electric trains.\nDavid: How does it teach students valuable lessons?\nHoa: It promotes standing behind yellow lines and emphasizes the vital role of station master.\nDavid: That is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in metro railway station or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that riding clean electric trains provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, safety platform doors continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Safety Rules on Public Trains and Metro Lines offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in metro railway station. Every year, thousands of people experience safety platform doors and celebrate standing behind yellow lines, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in riding clean electric trains gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize station master to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in metro railway station or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that riding clean electric trains provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, safety platform doors continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSafety Rules on Public Trains and Metro Lines offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in metro railway station. Every year, thousands of people experience safety platform doors and celebrate standing behind yellow lines, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in riding clean electric trains gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize station master to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of metro railway station; Why safety platform doors is important; Safety rules or cultural values; Your opinion.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Safety Rules on Public Trains and Metro Lines plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in metro railway station reminds everyone of the paramount importance of safety platform doors. When taking part in riding clean electric trains, people learn how standing behind yellow lines enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to station master ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
