          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Behind the Scenes of Action Stunt Performances.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of film production set; Why carefully rigged stunt wires is important; Safety rules or cultural values; Your opinion.",
          "options": [],
          "correct": "In my view, Behind the Scenes of Action Stunt Performances plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in film production set reminds everyone of the paramount importance of carefully rigged stunt wires. When taking part in practicing martial art stunts, people learn how protective safety pads enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to experienced stunt coordinator ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
