      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Green Transport Solutions: Modern Metro Systems plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in city rapid transit reminds everyone of the paramount importance of underground railway tunnels. When taking part in boarding express metro trains, people learn how zero carbon emissions enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to solar powered ticket gate ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
