          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Green Transport Solutions: Modern Metro Systems.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of city rapid transit; Why underground railway tunnels is important; Safety rules or cultural values; Your opinion.",
