      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Emergency Preparedness and Typhoon Warnings in Central Viet Nam at coastal fishing hamlet.\nTom: What is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nLinh: Experts and citizens are paying close attention to loudspeaker typhoon alert warnings and promoting securing wooden fishing boats.\nTom: How does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nLinh: It mitigates reinforcing tin corrugated roofs and emphasizes the vital function of emergency disaster relief kit.\nTom: Outstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In coastal fishing hamlet, stakeholders are addressing loudspeaker typhoon alert warnings to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in securing wooden fishing boats, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and emergency disaster relief kit guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Emergency Preparedness and Typhoon Warnings in Central Viet Nam addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing coastal fishing hamlet. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified loudspeaker typhoon alert warnings, necessitating urgent action on reinforcing tin corrugated roofs. Citizens and volunteers who commit to securing wooden fishing boats have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on emergency disaster relief kit to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In coastal fishing hamlet, stakeholders are addressing loudspeaker typhoon alert warnings to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in securing wooden fishing boats, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and emergency disaster relief kit guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nEmergency Preparedness and Typhoon Warnings in Central Viet Nam addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing coastal fishing hamlet. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified loudspeaker typhoon alert warnings, necessitating urgent action on reinforcing tin corrugated roofs. Citizens and volunteers who commit to securing wooden fishing boats have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on emergency disaster relief kit to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Problem in coastal fishing hamlet; Key factors like loudspeaker typhoon alert warnings; Recommended actions like securing wooden fishing boats; Importance of emergency disaster relief kit.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Emergency Preparedness and Typhoon Warnings in Central Viet Nam highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In coastal fishing hamlet, the consequences of loudspeaker typhoon alert warnings underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in securing wooden fishing boats, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting emergency disaster relief kit ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
