          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Emergency Preparedness and Typhoon Warnings in Central Viet Nam.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Problem in coastal fishing hamlet; Key factors like loudspeaker typhoon alert warnings; Recommended actions like securing wooden fishing boats; Importance of emergency disaster relief kit.",
