          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Reforestation and Protecting Wildlife in Cuc Phuong National Park.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Problem in Cuc Phuong rainforest; Key factors like ancient Thousand-Year Banyan trees; Recommended actions like planting native tree saplings; Importance of forest ranger patrol.",
