          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Flea Markets and Second-Hand Clothing Thrift Culture.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Problem in weekend flea market; Key factors like vintage denim jackets; Recommended actions like swapping pre-loved garments; Importance of circular fashion workshop.",
