      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Surviving Earthquakes and Seismic Evacuation Drills at secondary school campus.\nDavid: What is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nHoa: Experts and citizens are paying close attention to under-desk earthquake drop drills and promoting practicing evacuation procedures.\nDavid: How does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nHoa: It mitigates evacuating along clear stairways and emphasizes the vital function of first-aid emergency kit.\nDavid: Outstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In secondary school campus, stakeholders are addressing under-desk earthquake drop drills to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in practicing evacuation procedures, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and first-aid emergency kit guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Surviving Earthquakes and Seismic Evacuation Drills addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing secondary school campus. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified under-desk earthquake drop drills, necessitating urgent action on evacuating along clear stairways. Citizens and volunteers who commit to practicing evacuation procedures have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on first-aid emergency kit to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In secondary school campus, stakeholders are addressing under-desk earthquake drop drills to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in practicing evacuation procedures, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and first-aid emergency kit guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSurviving Earthquakes and Seismic Evacuation Drills addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing secondary school campus. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified under-desk earthquake drop drills, necessitating urgent action on evacuating along clear stairways. Citizens and volunteers who commit to practicing evacuation procedures have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on first-aid emergency kit to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Problem in secondary school campus; Key factors like under-desk earthquake drop drills; Recommended actions like practicing evacuation procedures; Importance of first-aid emergency kit.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Surviving Earthquakes and Seismic Evacuation Drills highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In secondary school campus, the consequences of under-desk earthquake drop drills underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in practicing evacuation procedures, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting first-aid emergency kit ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
