      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Online Shopping Convenience versus Packaging Waste at e-commerce distribution hub.\nDavid: What is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nHoa: Experts and citizens are paying close attention to automated sorting conveyor belts and promoting choosing eco-friendly shipping.\nDavid: How does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nHoa: It mitigates excessive cardboard bubble wraps and emphasizes the vital function of recyclable paper tape.\nDavid: Outstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In e-commerce distribution hub, stakeholders are addressing automated sorting conveyor belts to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in choosing eco-friendly shipping, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and recyclable paper tape guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Online Shopping Convenience versus Packaging Waste addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing e-commerce distribution hub. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified automated sorting conveyor belts, necessitating urgent action on excessive cardboard bubble wraps. Citizens and volunteers who commit to choosing eco-friendly shipping have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on recyclable paper tape to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In e-commerce distribution hub, stakeholders are addressing automated sorting conveyor belts to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in choosing eco-friendly shipping, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and recyclable paper tape guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nOnline Shopping Convenience versus Packaging Waste addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing e-commerce distribution hub. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified automated sorting conveyor belts, necessitating urgent action on excessive cardboard bubble wraps. Citizens and volunteers who commit to choosing eco-friendly shipping have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on recyclable paper tape to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Problem in e-commerce distribution hub; Key factors like automated sorting conveyor belts; Recommended actions like choosing eco-friendly shipping; Importance of recyclable paper tape.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Online Shopping Convenience versus Packaging Waste highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In e-commerce distribution hub, the consequences of automated sorting conveyor belts underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in choosing eco-friendly shipping, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting recyclable paper tape ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
