          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Online Shopping Convenience versus Packaging Waste.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Problem in e-commerce distribution hub; Key factors like automated sorting conveyor belts; Recommended actions like choosing eco-friendly shipping; Importance of recyclable paper tape.",
          "options": [],
