      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Flash Floods and Mudslides Prevention in Mountainous Regions at steep mountain valley.\nTom: What is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nLinh: Experts and citizens are paying close attention to retaining stone gabion walls and promoting clearing drainage culverts.\nTom: How does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nLinh: It mitigates early flood warning sensors and emphasizes the vital function of mountain rescue squad.\nTom: Outstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In steep mountain valley, stakeholders are addressing retaining stone gabion walls to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in clearing drainage culverts, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and mountain rescue squad guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Flash Floods and Mudslides Prevention in Mountainous Regions addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing steep mountain valley. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified retaining stone gabion walls, necessitating urgent action on early flood warning sensors. Citizens and volunteers who commit to clearing drainage culverts have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on mountain rescue squad to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In steep mountain valley, stakeholders are addressing retaining stone gabion walls to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in clearing drainage culverts, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and mountain rescue squad guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nFlash Floods and Mudslides Prevention in Mountainous Regions addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing steep mountain valley. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified retaining stone gabion walls, necessitating urgent action on early flood warning sensors. Citizens and volunteers who commit to clearing drainage culverts have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on mountain rescue squad to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Problem in steep mountain valley; Key factors like retaining stone gabion walls; Recommended actions like clearing drainage culverts; Importance of mountain rescue squad.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Flash Floods and Mudslides Prevention in Mountainous Regions highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In steep mountain valley, the consequences of retaining stone gabion walls underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in clearing drainage culverts, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting mountain rescue squad ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
