          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Tsunami Early Warning Systems and Coastal Evacuation Maps.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Problem in coastal shoreline; Key factors like deep-ocean seismic buoys; Recommended actions like conducting tsunami evacuation drills; Importance of emergency coastal siren.",
