          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Urban Air Pollution and Low-Emission Green Zones.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Problem in city center boulevard; Key factors like real-time air quality monitors; Recommended actions like riding electric bicycles; Importance of roadside tree green canopy.",
