      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Consumer Rights and Returning Defective Electronic Goods at electronics retail store.\nDavid: What is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nHoa: Experts and citizens are paying close attention to official manufacturer warranties and promoting demanding refunds or exchanges.\nDavid: How does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nHoa: It mitigates clear purchase receipts and emphasizes the vital function of consumer protection helpline.\nDavid: Outstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In electronics retail store, stakeholders are addressing official manufacturer warranties to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in demanding refunds or exchanges, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and consumer protection helpline guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Consumer Rights and Returning Defective Electronic Goods addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing electronics retail store. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified official manufacturer warranties, necessitating urgent action on clear purchase receipts. Citizens and volunteers who commit to demanding refunds or exchanges have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on consumer protection helpline to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In electronics retail store, stakeholders are addressing official manufacturer warranties to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in demanding refunds or exchanges, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and consumer protection helpline guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nConsumer Rights and Returning Defective Electronic Goods addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing electronics retail store. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified official manufacturer warranties, necessitating urgent action on clear purchase receipts. Citizens and volunteers who commit to demanding refunds or exchanges have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on consumer protection helpline to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Problem in electronics retail store; Key factors like official manufacturer warranties; Recommended actions like demanding refunds or exchanges; Importance of consumer protection helpline.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Consumer Rights and Returning Defective Electronic Goods highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In electronics retail store, the consequences of official manufacturer warranties underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in demanding refunds or exchanges, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting consumer protection helpline ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
