      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Severe Droughts and Saltwater Intrusion in the Mekong Delta at Ben Tre coconut orchards.\nTom: What is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nLinh: Experts and citizens are paying close attention to brackish river salinometers and promoting monitoring soil salinity levels.\nTom: How does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nLinh: It mitigates deep freshwater storage ponds and emphasizes the vital function of drip irrigation hose.\nTom: Outstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In Ben Tre coconut orchards, stakeholders are addressing brackish river salinometers to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in monitoring soil salinity levels, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and drip irrigation hose guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Severe Droughts and Saltwater Intrusion in the Mekong Delta addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing Ben Tre coconut orchards. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified brackish river salinometers, necessitating urgent action on deep freshwater storage ponds. Citizens and volunteers who commit to monitoring soil salinity levels have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on drip irrigation hose to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In Ben Tre coconut orchards, stakeholders are addressing brackish river salinometers to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in monitoring soil salinity levels, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and drip irrigation hose guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSevere Droughts and Saltwater Intrusion in the Mekong Delta addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing Ben Tre coconut orchards. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified brackish river salinometers, necessitating urgent action on deep freshwater storage ponds. Citizens and volunteers who commit to monitoring soil salinity levels have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on drip irrigation hose to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Problem in Ben Tre coconut orchards; Key factors like brackish river salinometers; Recommended actions like monitoring soil salinity levels; Importance of drip irrigation hose.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Severe Droughts and Saltwater Intrusion in the Mekong Delta highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In Ben Tre coconut orchards, the consequences of brackish river salinometers underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in monitoring soil salinity levels, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting drip irrigation hose ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
