      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Culinary Arts: Simmering Fragrant Beef Noodle Soup Broth at traditional noodle kitchen.\nTom: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nLinh: Audiences and experts are intrigued by star anise and cinnamon aroma and eager to practice skimming boiling broth.\nTom: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nLinh: It showcases gently simmering beef bones and highlights the significance of carved wooden ladle.\nTom: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In traditional noodle kitchen, culinary masters and linguists emphasize star anise and cinnamon aroma as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace skimming boiling broth, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding gently simmering beef bones helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting carved wooden ladle paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Culinary Arts: Simmering Fragrant Beef Noodle Soup Broth represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in traditional noodle kitchen. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines star anise and cinnamon aroma with gently simmering beef bones. Travelers and researchers who practice skimming boiling broth gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight carved wooden ladle as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In traditional noodle kitchen, culinary masters and linguists emphasize star anise and cinnamon aroma as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace skimming boiling broth, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding gently simmering beef bones helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting carved wooden ladle paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nCulinary Arts: Simmering Fragrant Beef Noodle Soup Broth represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in traditional noodle kitchen. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines star anise and cinnamon aroma with gently simmering beef bones. Travelers and researchers who practice skimming boiling broth gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight carved wooden ladle as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in traditional noodle kitchen; Key factors like star anise and cinnamon aroma; Recommended practices like skimming boiling broth; Role of carved wooden ladle.",
