      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Ecotourism in Cat Tien National Park and Wildlife Trekking at Cat Tien rainforest.\nDavid: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nHoa: Audiences and experts are intrigued by canopy walkway observation towers and eager to practice trekking guided jungle paths.\nDavid: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nHoa: It showcases nocturnal wild deer spotting and highlights the significance of ranger wildlife permit.\nDavid: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In Cat Tien rainforest, culinary masters and linguists emphasize canopy walkway observation towers as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace trekking guided jungle paths, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding nocturnal wild deer spotting helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting ranger wildlife permit paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Ecotourism in Cat Tien National Park and Wildlife Trekking represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in Cat Tien rainforest. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines canopy walkway observation towers with nocturnal wild deer spotting. Travelers and researchers who practice trekking guided jungle paths gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight ranger wildlife permit as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In Cat Tien rainforest, culinary masters and linguists emphasize canopy walkway observation towers as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace trekking guided jungle paths, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding nocturnal wild deer spotting helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting ranger wildlife permit paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nEcotourism in Cat Tien National Park and Wildlife Trekking represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in Cat Tien rainforest. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines canopy walkway observation towers with nocturnal wild deer spotting. Travelers and researchers who practice trekking guided jungle paths gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight ranger wildlife permit as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in Cat Tien rainforest; Key factors like canopy walkway observation towers; Recommended practices like trekking guided jungle paths; Role of ranger wildlife permit.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Ecotourism in Cat Tien National Park and Wildlife Trekking represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in Cat Tien rainforest, it celebrates canopy walkway observation towers and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in trekking guided jungle paths enriches our understanding of community values and promotes nocturnal wild deer spotting. Furthermore, respecting ranger wildlife permit reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
