          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Ecotourism in Cat Tien National Park and Wildlife Trekking.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Setting in Cat Tien rainforest; Key factors like canopy walkway observation towers; Recommended practices like trekking guided jungle paths; Role of ranger wildlife permit.",
