          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about English as a Global Lingua Franca in International Trade.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Setting in diplomatic convention center; Key factors like multilingual business delegates; Recommended practices like negotiating trade agreements; Role of simultaneous interpreter booth.",
          "options": [],
          "correct": "In my view, English as a Global Lingua Franca in International Trade represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in diplomatic convention center, it celebrates multilingual business delegates and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in negotiating trade agreements enriches our understanding of community values and promotes standard international English. Furthermore, respecting simultaneous interpreter booth reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
