      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Mastering the Art of Crispy Steamed Rice Rolls (Banh Cuon) at street kitchen stall.\nDavid: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nHoa: Audiences and experts are intrigued by thin stretched steam cloth and eager to practice rolling steaming rice crepes.\nDavid: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nHoa: It showcases seasoned minced pork filling and highlights the significance of sweet fish sauce bowl.\nDavid: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In street kitchen stall, culinary masters and linguists emphasize thin stretched steam cloth as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace rolling steaming rice crepes, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding seasoned minced pork filling helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting sweet fish sauce bowl paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Mastering the Art of Crispy Steamed Rice Rolls (Banh Cuon) represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in street kitchen stall. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines thin stretched steam cloth with seasoned minced pork filling. Travelers and researchers who practice rolling steaming rice crepes gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight sweet fish sauce bowl as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In street kitchen stall, culinary masters and linguists emphasize thin stretched steam cloth as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace rolling steaming rice crepes, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding seasoned minced pork filling helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting sweet fish sauce bowl paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nMastering the Art of Crispy Steamed Rice Rolls (Banh Cuon) represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in street kitchen stall. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines thin stretched steam cloth with seasoned minced pork filling. Travelers and researchers who practice rolling steaming rice crepes gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight sweet fish sauce bowl as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in street kitchen stall; Key factors like thin stretched steam cloth; Recommended practices like rolling steaming rice crepes; Role of sweet fish sauce bowl.",
