          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Mastering the Art of Crispy Steamed Rice Rolls (Banh Cuon).\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Setting in street kitchen stall; Key factors like thin stretched steam cloth; Recommended practices like rolling steaming rice crepes; Role of sweet fish sauce bowl.",
