      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Traditional Braised Fish in Clay Pots (Ca Kho To) at delta family kitchen.\nTom: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nLinh: Audiences and experts are intrigued by thick caramelized fish sauce and eager to practice slow braising in clay pots.\nTom: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nLinh: It showcases fragrant black peppercorns and highlights the significance of terracotta earthen pot.\nTom: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In delta family kitchen, culinary masters and linguists emphasize thick caramelized fish sauce as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace slow braising in clay pots, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding fragrant black peppercorns helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting terracotta earthen pot paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Traditional Braised Fish in Clay Pots (Ca Kho To) represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in delta family kitchen. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines thick caramelized fish sauce with fragrant black peppercorns. Travelers and researchers who practice slow braising in clay pots gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight terracotta earthen pot as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In delta family kitchen, culinary masters and linguists emphasize thick caramelized fish sauce as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace slow braising in clay pots, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding fragrant black peppercorns helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting terracotta earthen pot paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTraditional Braised Fish in Clay Pots (Ca Kho To) represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in delta family kitchen. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines thick caramelized fish sauce with fragrant black peppercorns. Travelers and researchers who practice slow braising in clay pots gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight terracotta earthen pot as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in delta family kitchen; Key factors like thick caramelized fish sauce; Recommended practices like slow braising in clay pots; Role of terracotta earthen pot.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Traditional Braised Fish in Clay Pots (Ca Kho To) represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in delta family kitchen, it celebrates thick caramelized fish sauce and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in slow braising in clay pots enriches our understanding of community values and promotes fragrant black peppercorns. Furthermore, respecting terracotta earthen pot reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
