          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Traditional Braised Fish in Clay Pots (Ca Kho To).\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Setting in delta family kitchen; Key factors like thick caramelized fish sauce; Recommended practices like slow braising in clay pots; Role of terracotta earthen pot.",
