          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Marine Ecotourism and Coral Reef Restoration in Phu Quoc.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Setting in An Thoi archipelago; Key factors like transplanted nursery coral fragments; Recommended practices like snorkeling responsible dive sites; Role of marine biology biologist.",
