      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Borrowed Loanwords in English from French and Latin at university library.\nTom: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nLinh: Audiences and experts are intrigued by historical etymology charts and eager to practice tracing lexical root origins.\nTom: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nLinh: It showcases cross-cultural language borrowings and highlights the significance of antique etymological volume.\nTom: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In university library, culinary masters and linguists emphasize historical etymology charts as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace tracing lexical root origins, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding cross-cultural language borrowings helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting antique etymological volume paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Borrowed Loanwords in English from French and Latin represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in university library. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines historical etymology charts with cross-cultural language borrowings. Travelers and researchers who practice tracing lexical root origins gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight antique etymological volume as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In university library, culinary masters and linguists emphasize historical etymology charts as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace tracing lexical root origins, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding cross-cultural language borrowings helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting antique etymological volume paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBorrowed Loanwords in English from French and Latin represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in university library. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines historical etymology charts with cross-cultural language borrowings. Travelers and researchers who practice tracing lexical root origins gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight antique etymological volume as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in university library; Key factors like historical etymology charts; Recommended practices like tracing lexical root origins; Role of antique etymological volume.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Borrowed Loanwords in English from French and Latin represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in university library, it celebrates historical etymology charts and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in tracing lexical root origins enriches our understanding of community values and promotes cross-cultural language borrowings. Furthermore, respecting antique etymological volume reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
