      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Responsible Tourism Guidelines: Leaving No Trace Behind at national park trailhead.\nTom: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nLinh: Audiences and experts are intrigued by biodegradable waste receptacles and eager to practice packing out personal trash.\nTom: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nLinh: It showcases prohibiting loud acoustic speakers and highlights the significance of reusable hydration canteen.\nTom: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In national park trailhead, culinary masters and linguists emphasize biodegradable waste receptacles as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace packing out personal trash, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding prohibiting loud acoustic speakers helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting reusable hydration canteen paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Responsible Tourism Guidelines: Leaving No Trace Behind represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in national park trailhead. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines biodegradable waste receptacles with prohibiting loud acoustic speakers. Travelers and researchers who practice packing out personal trash gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight reusable hydration canteen as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In national park trailhead, culinary masters and linguists emphasize biodegradable waste receptacles as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace packing out personal trash, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding prohibiting loud acoustic speakers helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting reusable hydration canteen paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nResponsible Tourism Guidelines: Leaving No Trace Behind represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in national park trailhead. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines biodegradable waste receptacles with prohibiting loud acoustic speakers. Travelers and researchers who practice packing out personal trash gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight reusable hydration canteen as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in national park trailhead; Key factors like biodegradable waste receptacles; Recommended practices like packing out personal trash; Role of reusable hydration canteen.",
