      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about The Health Benefits of Traditional Vietnamese Herbal Teas at herbal apothecary.\nTom: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nLinh: Audiences and experts are intrigued by dried chrysanthemum and lotus blossoms and eager to practice steeping aromatic herbal infusions.\nTom: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nLinh: It showcases soothing digestive herbal properties and highlights the significance of ceramic tea infuser.\nTom: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In herbal apothecary, culinary masters and linguists emphasize dried chrysanthemum and lotus blossoms as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace steeping aromatic herbal infusions, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding soothing digestive herbal properties helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting ceramic tea infuser paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Health Benefits of Traditional Vietnamese Herbal Teas represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in herbal apothecary. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines dried chrysanthemum and lotus blossoms with soothing digestive herbal properties. Travelers and researchers who practice steeping aromatic herbal infusions gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight ceramic tea infuser as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In herbal apothecary, culinary masters and linguists emphasize dried chrysanthemum and lotus blossoms as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace steeping aromatic herbal infusions, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding soothing digestive herbal properties helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting ceramic tea infuser paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Health Benefits of Traditional Vietnamese Herbal Teas represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in herbal apothecary. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines dried chrysanthemum and lotus blossoms with soothing digestive herbal properties. Travelers and researchers who practice steeping aromatic herbal infusions gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight ceramic tea infuser as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in herbal apothecary; Key factors like dried chrysanthemum and lotus blossoms; Recommended practices like steeping aromatic herbal infusions; Role of ceramic tea infuser.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, The Health Benefits of Traditional Vietnamese Herbal Teas represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in herbal apothecary, it celebrates dried chrysanthemum and lotus blossoms and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in steeping aromatic herbal infusions enriches our understanding of community values and promotes soothing digestive herbal properties. Furthermore, respecting ceramic tea infuser reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
