          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Indian English: Syntax, Nuances, and Literature.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Setting in literature seminar; Key factors like distinctive South Asian cadence; Recommended practices like reading Booker Prize novels; Role of scholarly essay anthologies.",
