      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about The Secrets of Fermenting Traditional Hue Sour Pork (Nem Chua) at artisan culinary shop.\nDavid: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nHoa: Audiences and experts are intrigued by fermented lean pork and garlic and eager to practice fermenting at room temperature.\nDavid: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nHoa: It showcases wrapping in crisp guava leaves and highlights the significance of banana leaf wrap.\nDavid: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In artisan culinary shop, culinary masters and linguists emphasize fermented lean pork and garlic as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace fermenting at room temperature, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding wrapping in crisp guava leaves helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting banana leaf wrap paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Secrets of Fermenting Traditional Hue Sour Pork (Nem Chua) represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in artisan culinary shop. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines fermented lean pork and garlic with wrapping in crisp guava leaves. Travelers and researchers who practice fermenting at room temperature gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight banana leaf wrap as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In artisan culinary shop, culinary masters and linguists emphasize fermented lean pork and garlic as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace fermenting at room temperature, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding wrapping in crisp guava leaves helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting banana leaf wrap paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Secrets of Fermenting Traditional Hue Sour Pork (Nem Chua) represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in artisan culinary shop. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines fermented lean pork and garlic with wrapping in crisp guava leaves. Travelers and researchers who practice fermenting at room temperature gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight banana leaf wrap as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in artisan culinary shop; Key factors like fermented lean pork and garlic; Recommended practices like fermenting at room temperature; Role of banana leaf wrap.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, The Secrets of Fermenting Traditional Hue Sour Pork (Nem Chua) represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in artisan culinary shop, it celebrates fermented lean pork and garlic and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in fermenting at room temperature enriches our understanding of community values and promotes wrapping in crisp guava leaves. Furthermore, respecting banana leaf wrap reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
