      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Tom: Hi Linh! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nLinh: Hi Tom! I am presenting about Cultural Etiquette for International Travelers in Asia at tourism training academy.\nTom: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nLinh: Audiences and experts are intrigued by respectful temple dress codes and eager to practice learning polite greeting gestures.\nTom: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nLinh: It showcases removing shoes before entering homes and highlights the significance of international travel guide.\nTom: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In tourism training academy, culinary masters and linguists emphasize respectful temple dress codes as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace learning polite greeting gestures, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding removing shoes before entering homes helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting international travel guide paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Cultural Etiquette for International Travelers in Asia represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in tourism training academy. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines respectful temple dress codes with removing shoes before entering homes. Travelers and researchers who practice learning polite greeting gestures gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight international travel guide as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In tourism training academy, culinary masters and linguists emphasize respectful temple dress codes as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace learning polite greeting gestures, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding removing shoes before entering homes helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting international travel guide paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nCultural Etiquette for International Travelers in Asia represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in tourism training academy. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines respectful temple dress codes with removing shoes before entering homes. Travelers and researchers who practice learning polite greeting gestures gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight international travel guide as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in tourism training academy; Key factors like respectful temple dress codes; Recommended practices like learning polite greeting gestures; Role of international travel guide.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Cultural Etiquette for International Travelers in Asia represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in tourism training academy, it celebrates respectful temple dress codes and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in learning polite greeting gestures enriches our understanding of community values and promotes removing shoes before entering homes. Furthermore, respecting international travel guide reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
