      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Singaporean English (Singlish): Cultural Identity and Syntax at Singapore university.\nDavid: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nHoa: Audiences and experts are intrigued by expressive discourse particles (lah, leh) and eager to practice studying pragmatic linguistics.\nDavid: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nHoa: It showcases unique multicultural loanwords and highlights the significance of sociolinguistic journal.\nDavid: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In Singapore university, culinary masters and linguists emphasize expressive discourse particles (lah, leh) as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace studying pragmatic linguistics, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding unique multicultural loanwords helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting sociolinguistic journal paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Singaporean English (Singlish): Cultural Identity and Syntax represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in Singapore university. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines expressive discourse particles (lah, leh) with unique multicultural loanwords. Travelers and researchers who practice studying pragmatic linguistics gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight sociolinguistic journal as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In Singapore university, culinary masters and linguists emphasize expressive discourse particles (lah, leh) as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace studying pragmatic linguistics, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding unique multicultural loanwords helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting sociolinguistic journal paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSingaporean English (Singlish): Cultural Identity and Syntax represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in Singapore university. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines expressive discourse particles (lah, leh) with unique multicultural loanwords. Travelers and researchers who practice studying pragmatic linguistics gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight sociolinguistic journal as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in Singapore university; Key factors like expressive discourse particles (lah, leh); Recommended practices like studying pragmatic linguistics; Role of sociolinguistic journal.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Singaporean English (Singlish): Cultural Identity and Syntax represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in Singapore university, it celebrates expressive discourse particles (lah, leh) and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in studying pragmatic linguistics enriches our understanding of community values and promotes unique multicultural loanwords. Furthermore, respecting sociolinguistic journal reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
