          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Traditional Vegetarianism (An Chay) in Vietnamese Culture.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Setting in Buddhist pagoda kitchen; Key factors like tofu and mushroom culinary substitutes; Recommended practices like preparing vegetarian feasts; Role of wooden temple gong.",
