      "audioScript": "David: Hi Hoa! What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nHoa: Hi David! I am presenting about Digital Tourism: Virtual Reality Tours of World Heritage Sites at high-tech tourism pavilion.\nDavid: What is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nHoa: Audiences and experts are intrigued by photorealistic 360-degree VR scans and eager to practice exploring Angkor Wat in VR.\nDavid: How does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nHoa: It showcases immersive architectural walkthroughs and highlights the significance of VR headset display.\nDavid: Brilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In high-tech tourism pavilion, culinary masters and linguists emphasize photorealistic 360-degree VR scans as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace exploring Angkor Wat in VR, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding immersive architectural walkthroughs helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting VR headset display paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Digital Tourism: Virtual Reality Tours of World Heritage Sites represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in high-tech tourism pavilion. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines photorealistic 360-degree VR scans with immersive architectural walkthroughs. Travelers and researchers who practice exploring Angkor Wat in VR gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight VR headset display as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In high-tech tourism pavilion, culinary masters and linguists emphasize photorealistic 360-degree VR scans as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace exploring Angkor Wat in VR, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding immersive architectural walkthroughs helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting VR headset display paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nDigital Tourism: Virtual Reality Tours of World Heritage Sites represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in high-tech tourism pavilion. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines photorealistic 360-degree VR scans with immersive architectural walkthroughs. Travelers and researchers who practice exploring Angkor Wat in VR gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight VR headset display as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in high-tech tourism pavilion; Key factors like photorealistic 360-degree VR scans; Recommended practices like exploring Angkor Wat in VR; Role of VR headset display.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Digital Tourism: Virtual Reality Tours of World Heritage Sites represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in high-tech tourism pavilion, it celebrates photorealistic 360-degree VR scans and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in exploring Angkor Wat in VR enriches our understanding of community values and promotes immersive architectural walkthroughs. Furthermore, respecting VR headset display reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
